{"id":"644132","name":"擂椒皮蛋","author":"五加五左左","authorId":"11514294","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/644132/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"皮蛋","amount":"1个"},{"name":"辣椒","amount":"1根"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜","amount":"1瓣"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"一根辣椒截成三段，平底锅干煎。","img":"images/644132/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"中火煎。","img":"images/644132/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"反复煎。","img":"images/644132/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"翻面。","img":"images/644132/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"煎到能撕掉皮。","img":"images/644132/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"辣椒煎软以后，撕掉皮，皮蛋扒皮，一瓣大蒜。","img":"images/644132/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放在捣蒜罐里，捣碎，舂烂，加半匙盐。","img":"images/644132/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"下饭小凉菜，味道不错。","img":"images/644132/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}